    <title>Zivid | LinkedIn</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Zivid | 10,283 followers on LinkedIn. Industrial 3D color cameras for pick and place robotics. Random bin picking, piece picking, assembly, machine tending. | Zivid is a pure-play provider of structured light-based industrial 3D vision cameras for autonomous industrial robot cells, cobot cells, and other industrial automation systems. The company&amp;#39;s primary hardware products are the Zivid 3, Zivid 2+ R-series, Zivid 2+ and Zivid 2 3D color cameras. They are supported by companion software products: the Zivid Software Development Kit (SDK) and the Zivid Studio, a graphical user interface (GUI).">

