          <p class="break-words text-color-text" data-test-id="about-us__description">
              Zivid is a pure-play provider of structured light-based industrial 3D vision cameras for autonomous industrial robot cells, cobot cells, and other industrial automation systems. The company's primary hardware products are the Zivid 3, Zivid 2+ R-series, Zivid 2+ and Zivid 2 3D color cameras. They are supported by companion software products: the Zivid Software Development Kit (SDK) and the Zivid Studio, a graphical user interface (GUI). 
          </p>

