  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">𝐁𝐫𝐢𝐧𝐠𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐦𝐨𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐭𝐨 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐕𝐈𝐒𝐈𝐎𝐍 𝐭𝐫𝐚𝐝𝐞 𝐬𝐡𝐨𝐰! 👀➡️🦾

We're heading to <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fvision2026&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#VISION2026</a> in Stuttgart — and this year we're not just showing you how robots see... but also how they move!

📅 6–8 October
 📍 Hall 10, Booth 10E53, Messe Stuttgart

At our booth, you'll get the first live look at 𝒁𝒊𝒗𝒊𝒅 𝑴𝒐𝒕𝒊𝒐𝒏, our new motion planner technology. It plans fast, safe paths straight from the scene your Zivid camera captured — so you can scale robot deployments faster, with less manual programming and shorter integration time.

𝐏𝐞𝐫𝐜𝐞𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐰𝐚𝐬 𝐨𝐧𝐥𝐲 𝐡𝐚𝐥𝐟 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐩𝐫𝐨𝐛𝐥𝐞𝐦. 𝐌𝐨𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐢𝐬 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐧𝐞𝐱𝐭 𝐛𝐚𝐫𝐫𝐢𝐞𝐫 𝐰𝐞'𝐫𝐞 𝐛𝐫𝐞𝐚𝐤𝐢𝐧𝐠. 🚀

You'll also find our 𝒇𝒖𝒍𝒍 3𝑫 𝒄𝒂𝒎𝒆𝒓𝒂 𝒑𝒐𝒓𝒕𝒇𝒐𝒍𝒊𝒐 running live demos:
 🔹 Zivid 2+ R-series — surface finishing, assembly, piece picking, and more
 🔹 Zivid 3 — depalletizing, big bin picking, and other large-volume tasks

Don't forget to bring your own parts if you'd like us to image something specific!

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fvision2026&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#VISION2026</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmachinevision&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#MachineVision</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2F3dvision&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#3DVision</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Frobotics&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Robotics</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmotionplanning&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#MotionPlanning</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Findustrialautomation&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#IndustrialAutomation</a> <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/showcase/vision-fair/?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>VISION - World's leading trade fair for machine vision</a></p>
