  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        attributed-text-segment-list__content-truncated" dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Your robot is only as good as the data it sees.🤖

In this 25-minute webinar, our Field Application Engineer, <a class="link" href="https://kr.linkedin.com/in/leeyunseo1231?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Yunseo Lee</a>, unpacks the core challenges of industrial robot guidance and how high-performance 3D vision can address them. (English subtitles available.)

You’ll find answers to questions like:

➡️ Why “just detect the object” isn’t enough for reliable robot guidance
➡️ The four conditions that challenge 3D vision on the factory floor
➡️ What real point cloud data looks like in WAAM (wire arc additive manufacturing), sanding, and welding processes
➡️ Two real-world examples of 3D vision in action

Watch the full webinar here: <a class="link" href="https://bit.ly/4zZJsgV?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://bit.ly/4zZJsgV</a>

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Frobotguidance&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#RobotGuidance</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2F3dvision&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#3DVision</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmachinevision&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#MachineVision</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Frobotics&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Robotics</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmanufacturingautomation&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#ManufacturingAutomation</a>

-----------------

로봇의 성능은 결국 로봇이 보는 데이터에 달려 있습니다.🤖

이번 25분 웨비나에서는 지비드 코리아의 이윤서 엔지니어가 산업용 로봇 가이던스의 핵심 과제와 이를 고성능 3D 비전으로 해결하는 방법을 소개합니다. (영어 자막 제공)

웨비나에서 다음과 같은 질문에 대한 답을 확인해 보세요.

➡️ 신뢰성 높은 로봇 가이던스를 위해서는 왜 단순히 물체를 검출하는 것만으로 충분하지 않을까요?
➡️ 실제 공장 환경에서 3D 비전을 어렵게 만드는 네 가지 조건은 무엇일까요?
➡️ WAAM(와이어 아크 적층 제조), 샌딩, 용접 공정에서 실제 포인트 클라우드 데이터는 어떤 모습일까요?
➡️ 3D 비전이 실제 산업 현장에서 어떻게 활용되는지 보여주는 두 가지 사례

전체 웨비나는 여기에서 확인하세요: <a class="link" href="https://bit.ly/4zZJsgV?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://bit.ly/4zZJsgV</a></p>
          
            
                  
    

